    "title": "The Least of These Ministry files lawsuit against City of Roanoke - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago ROANOKE, Va. – The Least of These Ministry has filed a civil lawsuit against the City of Roanoke in its ongoing battle against zoning appeals. As previously reported on WSLS 10, the Least of These Ministry - a non-profit organization that provides assisted living to the homeless - first received zoning violations in February over its warming bus, outdoor lockers and a porta-potty. Read full article\n1",
